  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Awareness World Trade Organisation - Members MC13 and Beyond</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The World Trade Organization (WTO&apos;s) multilateral trading system has proven to be a valuable global public good. On the negotiating track however, progress had until recently stalled.The historical &quot;Geneva Package&quot; agreed at the 12th WTO Ministerial Conference (MC12) paves the way for intensified discussions towards MC13 set for 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
